SOFTWARE REDISTRIBUTION LICENCE PENDING

This repository is a private extraction of Lincoln-Environmental/Overlander,
commit ba503b8bde51d3f212199e81efc7038d9fffecc8, prepared at the owner's request.
The source checkout contains no top-level software licence establishing a
redistribution grant. This extraction does not select or grant a software
licence on behalf of the rights holders. Public release and redistribution
remain blocked until they confirm the applicable rights and licence.

The separately attributed LINZ terrain data have their own CC BY 4.0 terms;
see examples/purau/provenance.json and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. A terrain data
licence does not establish a licence for the software.
